###
    glyph tests

    the runtime glyph maps that fontmap.kode generates
###

use ../util/img ◆ glyphs

▸ glyphs

    ▸ every map scale decodes

        for scale in 2..7

            map = glyphs.forScale scale

            valid map ▸ true
            map['a'].length ▸ 8*scale*scale

            top = 0
            for i in 0...map['a'].length
                top = max top map['a'][i]
            (top > 0) ▸ true

            top = 0
            for i in 0...map[' '].length
                top = max top map[' '][i]
            top ▸ 0

    ▸ uppercase is included

        map = glyphs.forScale 4

        map['A'].length ▸ 8*4*4
        map['Z'].length ▸ 8*4*4

    ▸ forScale and forSize share their decoded map

        (glyphs.forScale(5) == glyphs.forSize(10, 20)) ▸ true

    ▸ unknown scales have no map

        glyphs.forScale 1 ▸ null
        glyphs.forScale 8 ▸ null
